sender alice basic
sender bob pro
sender cora bulk
recipient rx
recipient ny tz=-05:00
recipient tokyo tz=+09:00
set dispatch.batch 2
set-for rx dispatch.per_recipient 2
send a1 alice rx alice one
send a2 alice rx alice two
send a3 alice rx alice three
send b1 bob rx bob one
send b2 bob rx bob two
send c1 cora rx cora one
advance 5s
report senders
